    <h1>Facing Foreclosure in Texas: A Calm Guide to Understanding Your Options</h1>
    <p>If you have fallen behind on your mortgage, or you have received a letter you are afraid to open, you are not alone, and you are not out of options just because the situation feels heavy. Many responsible homeowners go through a period like this after a job change, a reduction in income, a divorce, an illness, or an unexpected expense.</p>
